      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Dame Elizabeth Wordsworth {'1': \", '2': \", '3': \", '4': \"} (1840–1932) was the great-niece of the poet William Wordsworth. She was the daughter of Christopher Wordsworth, Bishop of Lincoln, and the sister of John Wordsworth, Bishop of Salisbury, and Christopher Wordsworth, a liturgical scholar.",
